{# Contenu par défaut des notifications des départs (NotificationTargetDeparture), semé à l'installation.
   Texte figé, balises ##…## de GLPI ; nom et destinataires restent dans la classe. #}
{%- block departure_created__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Restitution de votre matériel : ##departure.count## élément(s) à signer{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##departure.user##,</p><p>Dans le cadre de votre départ, merci de restituer le matériel suivant et de signer la fiche de restitution :</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Consulter et signer la restitution</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Returning your equipment: ##departure.count## item(s) to sign{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##departure.user##,</p><p>As part of your departure, please return the following equipment and sign the return form:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">View and sign the return</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Devolución de su material: ##departure.count## elemento(s) que firmar{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##departure.user##,</p><p>Con motivo de su salida, devuelva el siguiente material y firme la ficha de devolución:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Consultar y firmar la devolución</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Rückgabe Ihrer Geräte: ##departure.count## Element(e) zu unterschreiben{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##departure.user##,</p><p>Im Rahmen Ihres Austritts geben Sie bitte die folgenden Geräte zurück und unterschreiben das Rückgabeformular:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Rückgabe ansehen und unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Restituzione della sua attrezzatura: ##departure.count## elemento/i da firmare{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_created__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##departure.user##,</p><p>In vista della sua partenza, la preghiamo di restituire la seguente attrezzatura e di firmare la scheda di restituzione:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Consultare e firmare la restituzione</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Rappel : restitution de votre matériel à signer{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##departure.user##,</p><p>La restitution du matériel suivant attend toujours votre signature :</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Signer la restitution</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Reminder: equipment return awaiting your signature{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##departure.user##,</p><p>The return of the following equipment is still awaiting your signature:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Sign the return</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Recordatorio: devolución de su material pendiente de firma{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##departure.user##,</p><p>La devolución del siguiente material sigue pendiente de su firma:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Firmar la devolución</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Erinnerung: Rückgabe Ihrer Geräte wartet auf Ihre Unterschrift{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##departure.user##,</p><p>Die Rückgabe der folgenden Geräte wartet noch auf Ihre Unterschrift:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Rückgabe unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Promemoria: restituzione della sua attrezzatura da firmare{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_reminder__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##departure.user##,</p><p>La restituzione della seguente attrezzatura è ancora in attesa della sua firma:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Firmare la restituzione</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Restitution signée : ##departure.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##departure.user## a signé la restitution de ##departure.count## matériel(s) :</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Voir le départ et le PDF récapitulatif</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Return signed: ##departure.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##departure.user## signed the return of ##departure.count## item(s):</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">View the departure and the summary PDF</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Devolución firmada: ##departure.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##departure.user## firmó la devolución de ##departure.count## elemento(s):</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Ver la salida y el PDF resumen</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Rückgabe unterschrieben: ##departure.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##departure.user## hat die Rückgabe von ##departure.count## Gerät(en) unterschrieben:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Austritt und Zusammenfassungs-PDF ansehen</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Restituzione firmata: ##departure.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block departure_signed__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##departure.user## ha firmato la restituzione di ##departure.count## elemento/i:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##departure.sign_url##">Vedere la partenza e il PDF riepilogativo</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
